    {
      "q": "What does Treasury buy?",
      "a": "The Department of the Treasury buys a mix of metal processing and IT services in FY2026 to date. Nonferrous Metal (except Aluminum) Smelting and Refining accounted for $1.2B, Other Computer Related Services accounted for $1B, and Computer Systems Design Services accounted for $609M. Additional notable categories include Nonferrous Metal Rolling, Drawing, and Extruding at $499M and Custom Computer Programming Services at $272M."
